<title>USA: SunSource LP sets unchanged payout.</title>
<headline>SunSource LP sets unchanged payout.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunSource LP said on Monday an unchanged monthly cash distribution of $0.091666 was declared for the month of February for each Class A limited partnership interest, payable February 28 to holders of record on January 31.</p>
</text>
